d":75980,"show_name":"Rachael Ray's Meals in Minutes","show_image":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/513/1284623.jpg","season":6,"episode":6,"episode_name":"Beef Tartare","airdate":"2026-10-19","airtime":"21:30","summary":"Rachael serves a classic beef tartare with tender center-cut filet dressed with shallots, capers, anchovies, and more. While the dish comes together, John mixes a \"Tableside Martartaretini,\" a refreshing cocktail of gin, vodka, elderberry syrup, and muddled cucumbers. "},{"id":3654227,"show_id":90632,"show_name":"Line of Fire","show_image":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/641/1604426.jpg","season":1,"episode":5,"episode_name":"Cul-de-sac","airdate":"2026-10-19","airtime":"22:00","summary":"Clare goes under cover with a new partner; Jane and Nia search for a mole in the Task Force; Russ and Micah unearth new evidence in the Barnes assassination attempt."},{"id":3769678,"show_id":87566,"show_name":"Harlan Coben's Final Twist","show_image":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/607/1518169.jpg","season":2,"episode":3,"episode_name":"Camilo's Secret","airdate":"2026-10-19","airtime":"22:00","summary":"In June 2011, Miami businessman Camilo Salazar drops his baby off at his wife's office and is never seen again. Across town, a business magnate goes missing on the same day. When detectives connect the two missing-person cases, the investigation stretches from Camilo's tight-knit family into South Florida's business elite and the world of professional mixed martial arts fighting. Through years of dogged investigative work and piecing together phone records, detectives slowly connect a circle of men with wildly different lives. As the case grows colder, what emerges is a sprawling conspiracy that ultimately takes investigators from Miami all the way to Europe."},{"id":3773455,"show_id":9312,"show_name":"The Last Word with Lawrence O'Donnell","show_image":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploa